From f63e155e01cafdf683e87894a00310eb96bbfd0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wmehanna <wassimmehanna@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:43:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] perf(arm): host SHA-NI and PSHUFB paths for SHA-256 and
 TBL/TBX

Use the host instructions for the AArch64 SHA-256 helpers and for the
vector TBL and TBX helpers when cpuinfo reports them. Adds h1-hostops
and builds bti-guarded with clang (x16 is an output there).
---
